WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:03.617
- Santa, I can definitely
tell you're not a cheap guy

00:00:03.617 --> 00:00:05.458
at the mall saying, "Sit on my lap.

00:00:05.458 --> 00:00:08.252
What do you want for Christmas?"
This beard sticks on.

00:00:08.602 --> 00:00:09.255
- Yeah.

00:00:09.415 --> 00:00:14.192
("Santas Anthem")

00:00:14.192 --> 00:00:15.148
- I'm Jewish.

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:16.807
- We celebrate Hanukkah.

00:00:16.807 --> 00:00:18.147
- I like lighting the candles,

00:00:18.147 --> 00:00:20.234
like those people did in the desert.

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:21.891
- I like to spin the dreidel.

00:00:21.891 --> 00:00:23.934
- I like potatoes latkes a lot.

00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:25.609
- Hanukkah's about being with your family,

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:28.564
but I'm a little dirty, I
like the presents myself.

00:00:29.277 --> 00:00:32.364
- Santa doesn't come to my
house because I'm Jewish.

00:00:32.684 --> 00:00:35.459
And also, I don't believe in Santa Claus.

00:00:35.593 --> 00:00:37.647
- On Christmas Eve, he
goes into your house

00:00:37.647 --> 00:00:39.523
and gives you presents
through the chimney.

00:00:39.992 --> 00:00:41.961
- And Santa has reindeers.

00:00:42.349 --> 00:00:44.584
- He has a list of nice and naughty.

00:00:44.752 --> 00:00:48.026
- And the thing I don't
believe is he lives forever.

00:00:48.026 --> 00:00:50.603
Now that's what kind of
puts me on the fence there.

00:00:50.673 --> 00:00:53.029
("Santas Anthem")

00:00:53.029 --> 00:00:54.626
- I never met Santa before.

00:00:56.310 --> 00:00:56.935
Yeah.

00:00:58.922 --> 00:01:00.001
- Ho, ho ho!

00:01:00.001 --> 00:01:01.976
(Santa laughing)

00:01:02.325 --> 00:01:05.424
Oh my goodness. It's me Santa Claus.

00:01:05.812 --> 00:01:07.583
I'm so glad to see you.

00:01:08.831 --> 00:01:10.358
- Is his beard real?

00:01:11.768 --> 00:01:13.841
- Can I sit there? Here,
let me help you out.

00:01:17.513 --> 00:01:19.579
(Santa laughing)

00:01:21.951 --> 00:01:23.081
- Umm.

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:28.591
- Do you hang out with Hairy Hanukkah?

00:01:28.926 --> 00:01:30.894
- I love back scratchers, by the way.

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:33.622
(Santa laughing)

00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:35.949
- So the dreidel came
as you spin the dreidel

00:01:35.949 --> 00:01:38.181
with your friend, probably
you need two people.

00:01:38.181 --> 00:01:40.718
- But then I turn smaller when
I go down in the chimneys.

00:01:40.718 --> 00:01:42.730
And then pop back out into normal size.

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:47.238
- No. I'm sure.

00:01:47.238 --> 00:01:48.396
(Santa laughing)

00:01:48.396 --> 00:01:51.716
- You probably land on
something like a Hebrew leather,

00:01:51.716 --> 00:01:53.456
and whatever it says, you do.

00:01:53.456 --> 00:01:56.566
- I have to go swoosh,
poop. And here I am again.

00:01:56.566 --> 00:01:58.596
(Santa laughing)

00:01:58.596 --> 00:02:00.707
- It's some strange stories for sure.

00:02:01.014 --> 00:02:02.507
(Santa laughing)

00:02:06.435 --> 00:02:07.266
- No.

00:02:07.458 --> 00:02:11.141
- It's not about presents. You
need to be you and live life.

00:02:11.141 --> 00:02:13.811
If it means no presents
and being with your family,

00:02:14.071 --> 00:02:15.507
sometimes you gonna live with it.

00:02:16.512 --> 00:02:18.748
- And I feel exactly the same way.

00:02:19.101 --> 00:02:21.238
- Santa, I wanna give you a cookie.

00:02:21.238 --> 00:02:24.559
- Oh well, thank you,
sweetie. I appreciate that.

00:02:24.559 --> 00:02:28.053
("Santas Anthem")

00:02:28.063 --> 00:02:29.737
You wanna take a little
bite off the other end?

00:02:29.877 --> 00:02:30.490
- No.

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:31.269
(Santa laughing)

00:02:31.269 --> 00:02:36.269
("Santas Anthem")

00:02:36.769 --> 00:02:38.663
- #imetSanta

00:02:38.663 --> 00:02:39.924
(Santa laughing)

00:02:39.924 --> 00:02:41.490
- Santa, I'm Jewish but I love you.

00:02:41.588 --> 00:02:43.916
- Thank you, sweetie. I love you, too.

